        {
          "title": "ATM Withdrawals and PINs",
          "content": "For ATM withdrawals abroad, ensure you use ATMs bearing the VISA – Plus Logo that support {{faq_6f303f5f_001}}-digit PINs, as our cards are not compatible with {{faq_6f303f5f_002}}-digit PIN ATMs. If you have both credit and savings accounts on your card, select 'Savings Account' at the ATM to avoid cash advance fees and interest charges effective from {{faq_6f303f5f_003}} Feb {{faq_6f303f5f_004}}."
        },
